{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1358242-spiritualists-in-trinity-continuum","id":1358242,"title":"Spiritualists in Trinity Continuum","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-01T13:54:45-08:00","id":1358242,"title":"Spiritualists in Trinity Continuum","content":"Hello everyone,<br /> <br /> I was thinking about a possible setting in the Victorian Age, with all the spiritualists and parapsychologists. In a first approach, we can treat the dead as... well... dead, no return and no contact to the \u201cother side\u201d, with the spiritualists and mediums as misleads, mesmerista exploring people, people being explored by Mesmerists or liers...<br /> <br /> But, there are a few things that we can gather here and there that allow us to believe there can be more...<br /> First, there are ways to live without a body for both novas and psions, what means it\u2019s possible to have a conscience with no physical manifestation.<br /> Second, In Media Res show us the existence of artefacts that can store ephemeral people, in this case they were recorded and were still alive after (but not during the events of the story), so they are more like a copy than a stored conscience, but still...<br /> <br /> My idea for this discussion is more about how the way spirits and other ephemeral creatures interact with Flux, Psi and Quantum than if they can or cannot exist in the setting. What do you think?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tome